        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-4 font-semibold">— Depop seller, 200+ items</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-xl p-6 scroll-reveal">
        <div class="flex gap-0.5 mb-4">
          <% 5.times do %><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg><% end %>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground leading-relaxed italic">"The CSV import alone saved me a full weekend. Had 300 items uploaded and organized in under an hour."</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-4 font-semibold">— Poshmark + eBay seller</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-xl p-6 scroll-reveal">
        <div class="flex gap-0.5 mb-4">
          <% 5.times do %><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg><% end %>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-foreground leading-relaxed italic">"I cross-list on 4 platforms. Before ThriftBot I had no idea which one was actually profitable. Now I do."</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-4 font-semibold">— Full-time reseller, Grailed + Mercari</p>
